# Preflight UI local CI checks

Unless told otherwise, validate **only files you changed**.

## Before finishing any change

1. Update `README.md` when behavior, env vars, or bootstrap flow changes.
2. Add a changelog entry if the repo tracks releases (follow existing pattern).
3. Run the same checks as [.github/workflows/ci.yml](.github/workflows/ci.yml).

## Commands (repo root)

```bash
npm install
npm run build
node server.js &   # smoke: curl -sf http://127.0.0.1:8080/ | grep -q '<div id="root">'
bash <(curl -sSL https://raw.githubusercontent.com/rhysd/actionlint/main/scripts/download-actionlint.bash)
./actionlint -color
```

## ADO collection changes

When preflight overlays or vendors collection files (`docker/apply_aap_25_plus.yml`, etc.), also follow `ado` repo rules in `.cursor/rules/ado-ci-local-checks.mdc`.
